    <body>
      <div n="1" type="scan" corresp="https://iiif.lib.keio.ac.jp/FJK/F-i-1/pdf/F-i-1.pdf#page=1">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <note type="editorial">background</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <ab type="cover_title" n="f01-left-cover_title-01" xml:id="u-f01-left-cover_title-01">醫案</ab>
          <note type="editorial">cover_title</note>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="2" type="scan" corresp="https://iiif.lib.keio.ac.jp/FJK/F-i-1/pdf/F-i-1.pdf#page=2">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <note type="editorial">holding_marks</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <ab type="inner_title" n="f02-left-inner_title-01" xml:id="u-f02-left-inner_title-01">己未</ab>
          <ab type="inner_title" n="f02-left-inner_title-02" xml:id="u-f02-left-inner_title-02">醫案</ab>
          <ab type="inner_annotation" n="f02-left-inner_annotation-01" xml:id="u-f02-left-inner_annotation-01">□日參□之</ab>
          <note type="editorial">inner_title_annotation</note>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="3" type="scan" corresp="https://iiif.lib.keio.ac.jp/FJK/F-i-1/pdf/F-i-1.pdf#page=3">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <note type="editorial">seal</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <ab type="body" n="f03-left-body-01" xml:id="u-f03-left-body-01">醫案</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f03-left-body-02" xml:id="u-f03-left-body-02">安政戊午之秋都鄙一種之奇病大流布</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f03-left-body-03" xml:id="u-f03-left-body-03">其癥俄然吐瀉頻數心下有水飲瀝々有</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f03-left-body-04" xml:id="u-f03-left-body-04">聲掣痛如刀被刺四支厥冷煩燥其緩漫</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f03-left-body-05" xml:id="u-f03-left-body-05">者脉微々如蜘蛛之糸其急劇者危刻脉</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f03-left-body-06" xml:id="u-f03-left-body-06">厥或有發轉筋者或有大煩渇喜引冷水</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f03-left-body-07" xml:id="u-f03-left-body-07">熱湯不入口者或有舌上白胎者或有黃</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f03-left-body-08" xml:id="u-f03-left-body-08">胎乾而不渇者或有無胎黑舌者或乾燥</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f03-left-body-09" xml:id="u-f03-left-body-09">或滑澤其佗症候千變万化不暇枚舉於</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f03-left-body-10" xml:id="u-f03-left-body-10">此與白虎湯或白虎加人□又〔缺損〕虎加桂</ab>
          <ab type="red_head_note" n="f03-left-red_head_note-01" xml:id="u-f03-left-red_head_note-01">現症不盡于此宜□□</ab>
          <ab type="red_head_note" n="f03-left-red_head_note-02" xml:id="u-f03-left-red_head_note-02">書之</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f03-left-red_inline-01" xml:id="u-f03-left-red_inline-01">行</ab>
          <note type="editorial">body_red</note>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="4" type="scan" corresp="https://iiif.lib.keio.ac.jp/FJK/F-i-1/pdf/F-i-1.pdf#page=4">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <ab type="body" n="f04-right-body-01" xml:id="u-f04-right-body-01">枝之輩煩渇不減下利〔缺損〕余因思</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f04-right-body-02" xml:id="u-f04-right-body-02">虚火炎上之所致也再與既濟真武四逆</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f04-right-body-03" xml:id="u-f04-right-body-03">諸湯亦無寸効而為泉客者不識幾千人</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f04-right-body-04" xml:id="u-f04-right-body-04">衆医徒束手是歟矣余喟然歎息廢業忘</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f04-right-body-05" xml:id="u-f04-right-body-05">寐食沈思數囘無良策一日偶讀書櫃所</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f04-right-body-06" xml:id="u-f04-right-body-06">藏之痧脹玉衡書然後得清凉至寶飲方</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f04-right-body-07" xml:id="u-f04-right-body-07">刺絡之術試施之覺有効驗雖然猶未能</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f04-right-body-08" xml:id="u-f04-right-body-08">盡挽囘技術至于此窮矣因問於方道長</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f04-right-body-09" xml:id="u-f04-right-body-09">尾先生先生默而不言少時示余曰若有</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f04-right-body-10" xml:id="u-f04-right-body-10">心下水飲而吐利數行煩渇者千金瀉心</ab>
          <ab type="black_head_note" n="f04-right-black_head_note-01" xml:id="u-f04-right-black_head_note-01">霍亂又曰先之所□□</ab>
          <ab type="black_head_note" n="f04-right-black_head_note-02" xml:id="u-f04-right-black_head_note-02">治溫熱有醫証症□</ab>
          <ab type="black_head_note" n="f04-right-black_head_note-03" xml:id="u-f04-right-black_head_note-03">□□進退發□</ab>
          <ab type="black_head_note" n="f04-right-black_head_note-04" xml:id="u-f04-right-black_head_note-04">□□□血□</ab>
          <ab type="black_head_note" n="f04-right-black_head_note-05" xml:id="u-f04-right-black_head_note-05">從前□進□□</ab>
          <ab type="black_head_note" n="f04-right-black_head_note-06" xml:id="u-f04-right-black_head_note-06">腸□□</ab>
          <ab type="black_head_note" n="f04-right-black_head_note-07" xml:id="u-f04-right-black_head_note-07">近日</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f04-right-red_inline-01" xml:id="u-f04-right-red_inline-01">死不救</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f04-right-red_inline-02" xml:id="u-f04-right-red_inline-02">數十</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f04-right-red_inline-03" xml:id="u-f04-right-red_inline-03">而已</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f04-right-red_inline-04" xml:id="u-f04-right-red_inline-04">因</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f04-right-red_inline-05" xml:id="u-f04-right-red_inline-05">稍</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f04-right-red_inline-06" xml:id="u-f04-right-red_inline-06">問之</ab>
          <note type="editorial">body_black_red</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <ab type="body" n="f04-left-body-01" xml:id="u-f04-left-body-01">湯或刪繁半夏瀉心湯可也若既吐煩燥</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f04-left-body-02" xml:id="u-f04-left-body-02">四肢厥冷者吴茱萸湯或從症黃連湯或</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f04-left-body-03" xml:id="u-f04-left-body-03">三黃湯之輩亦可也余退而以此方與此</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f04-left-body-04" xml:id="u-f04-left-body-04">症奏効嘻嗟是以救危篤之者數十許人</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f04-left-body-05" xml:id="u-f04-left-body-05">不堪雀躍刀圭之餘聊為世俗述其端以</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f04-left-body-06" xml:id="u-f04-left-body-06">示同志于時仲秋念二於東都長尾氏燈</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f04-left-body-07" xml:id="u-f04-left-body-07">下相陽遊學生秦齋池田平謹誌之</ab>
          <ab type="red_head_note" n="f04-left-red_head_note-01" xml:id="u-f04-left-red_head_note-01">雀躍二字置之亦可</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f04-left-red_inline-01" xml:id="u-f04-left-red_inline-01">其所現</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f04-left-red_inline-02" xml:id="u-f04-left-red_inline-02">病之□有病有□則</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f04-left-red_inline-03" xml:id="u-f04-left-red_inline-03">書之</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f04-left-red_inline-04" xml:id="u-f04-left-red_inline-04">條然</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f04-left-red_comment-01" xml:id="u-f04-left-red_comment-01">去歳惡疫之行人多死非命雖曰氣運或医治乖誤目</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f04-left-red_comment-02" xml:id="u-f04-left-red_comment-02">為泉客者十居六七為司命之官者所以不可不講究</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f04-left-red_comment-03" xml:id="u-f04-left-red_comment-03">之於平日臨危避厄而濟其生也〔缺損〕少傷寒論</ab>
          <note type="editorial">body_red</note>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="5" type="scan" corresp="https://iiif.lib.keio.ac.jp/FJK/F-i-1/pdf/F-i-1.pdf#page=5">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f05-right-red_comment-01" xml:id="u-f05-right-red_comment-01">中諄々垂戒萬病千症雖不可〔缺損〕明且於此莫</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f05-right-red_comment-02" xml:id="u-f05-right-red_comment-02">不隨手效者始少誤人耳何知後人容易讀去</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f05-right-red_comment-03" xml:id="u-f05-right-red_comment-03">未甞留神于此々尋常疾病猶不能救況於竒</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f05-right-red_comment-04" xml:id="u-f05-right-red_comment-04">病異症哉孫真人曰學無日夜行動致顛墜嗟今</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f05-right-red_comment-05" xml:id="u-f05-right-red_comment-05">之為醫者危哉云々</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f05-right-red-inline-review-01" xml:id="u-f05-right-red-inline-review-01">奏</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f05-right-red-inline-review-02" xml:id="u-f05-right-red-inline-review-02">之</ab>
          <note type="editorial">red_comment</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <ab type="body" n="f05-left-body-01" xml:id="u-f05-left-body-01">一婦新婚不日小腹成塊大如臂其痛如</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f05-left-body-02" xml:id="u-f05-left-body-02">淋自不能捫又不能起卧大小便共秘衆</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f05-left-body-03" xml:id="u-f05-left-body-03">医為血塊調理其病日重使余診之其脉</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f05-left-body-04" xml:id="u-f05-left-body-04">沈緊有力余曰非血塊此腸癰膿已成也</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f05-left-body-05" xml:id="u-f05-left-body-05">使服大黃牡丹皮湯不□時腹中雷鳴忽</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f05-left-body-06" xml:id="u-f05-left-body-06">下膿一椀痛即減舉家喜曰慶此藥諸多</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f05-left-body-07" xml:id="u-f05-left-body-07">服余曰可又與三貼下如魚腦者約六七</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f05-left-body-08" xml:id="u-f05-left-body-08">椀苦楚脫然如故自起行圍再診之脉緩</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f05-left-body-09" xml:id="u-f05-left-body-09">遲轉與千金内托散五六貼氣力復元精</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f05-left-body-10" xml:id="u-f05-left-body-10">神亦爽慧飮食如常</ab>
          <ab type="red_head_note" n="f05-left-red_head_note-01" xml:id="u-f05-left-red_head_note-01">緩遲二字轉置為可</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f05-left-red_inline-01" xml:id="u-f05-left-red_inline-01">起卧</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f05-left-red_inline-02" xml:id="u-f05-left-red_inline-02">困頓</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f05-left-red_inline-03" xml:id="u-f05-left-red_inline-03">便</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f05-left-red_inline-04" xml:id="u-f05-left-red_inline-04">益</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f05-left-red_inline-05" xml:id="u-f05-left-red_inline-05">始</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f05-left-red_inline-06" xml:id="u-f05-left-red_inline-06">須臾</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f05-left-red_inline-07" xml:id="u-f05-left-red_inline-07">藥效如此命亦無恙願</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f05-left-red_inline-08" xml:id="u-f05-left-red_inline-08">四</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f05-left-red_inline-09" xml:id="u-f05-left-red_inline-09">前方</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f05-left-red_inline-10" xml:id="u-f05-left-red_inline-10">頓</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f05-left-red_inline-11" xml:id="u-f05-left-red_inline-11">四</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f05-left-red_inline-12" xml:id="u-f05-left-red_inline-12">而</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f05-left-red_inline-13" xml:id="u-f05-left-red_inline-13">更</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f05-left-red_inline-14" xml:id="u-f05-left-red_inline-14">遲</ab>
          <note type="editorial">body_red</note>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="6" type="scan" corresp="https://iiif.lib.keio.ac.jp/FJK/F-i-1/pdf/F-i-1.pdf#page=6">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <ab type="body" n="f06-right-body-01" xml:id="u-f06-right-body-01">東都麹街大住屋吉兵衞□十餘腹張</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f06-right-body-02" xml:id="u-f06-right-body-02">如鼔轉側小腹有雷鳴余曰此腸癰膿已</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f06-right-body-03" xml:id="u-f06-right-body-03">成也把蘭製板将刺之一瘍医留此余不</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f06-right-body-04" xml:id="u-f06-right-body-04">可刺之寸餘膿血如濁淋溝出内使服活</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f06-right-body-05" xml:id="u-f06-right-body-05">血散瘀湯外傅透雲膏膿滅而後轉使服</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f06-right-body-06" xml:id="u-f06-right-body-06">十全大補湯月餘而全愈</ab>
          <ab type="red_head_note" n="f06-right-red_head_note-01" xml:id="u-f06-right-red_head_note-01">蘭製板ト云フ□ノ字何</ab>
          <ab type="red_head_note" n="f06-right-red_head_note-02" xml:id="u-f06-right-red_head_note-02">ノ書ニ出ルヤ</ab>
          <ab type="red_head_note" n="f06-right-red_head_note-03" xml:id="u-f06-right-red_head_note-03">蓋就柳葉鍼</ab>
          <ab type="red_head_note" n="f06-right-red_head_note-04" xml:id="u-f06-right-red_head_note-04">□ンセツカ</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f06-right-red_inline-01" xml:id="u-f06-right-red_inline-01">聲</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f06-right-red_inline-02" xml:id="u-f06-right-red_inline-02">之</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f06-right-red_inline-03" xml:id="u-f06-right-red_inline-03">流</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f06-right-red_inline-04" xml:id="u-f06-right-red_inline-04">痛卻</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f06-right-red_inline-05" xml:id="u-f06-right-red_inline-05">雖然</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f06-right-red_inline-06" xml:id="u-f06-right-red_inline-06">膿或滿</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f06-right-red_inline-07" xml:id="u-f06-right-red_inline-07">内不刺</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f06-right-red_inline-08" xml:id="u-f06-right-red_inline-08">不利於</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f06-right-red_inline-09" xml:id="u-f06-right-red_inline-09">也</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f06-right-red_comment-01" xml:id="u-f06-right-red_comment-01">腸癰有二途用大黃牡丹湯等破血下膿愈者是腸内生</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f06-right-red_comment-02" xml:id="u-f06-right-red_comment-02">瘍也外腫焮熱刺之治者此腸外釀膿也施治者必先</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f06-right-red_comment-03" xml:id="u-f06-right-red_comment-03">辨其來由二途判然而後行術可此篇前後之按亦屬</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f06-right-red_comment-04" xml:id="u-f06-right-red_comment-04">内外治法已故聊告之</ab>
          <note type="editorial">body_red</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <ab type="body" n="f06-left-body-01" xml:id="u-f06-left-body-01">治有表裡先後辨</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f06-left-body-02" xml:id="u-f06-left-body-02">夫医之用藥猶將之用兵攻其可攻補其</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f06-left-body-03" xml:id="u-f06-left-body-03">可補進退緩急臨機應變詳察病情而後</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f06-left-body-04" xml:id="u-f06-left-body-04">從其宜是如將之用兵也今夫治有表裡</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f06-left-body-05" xml:id="u-f06-left-body-05">先後之別有先救表後救裡法何經曰太</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f06-left-body-06" xml:id="u-f06-left-body-06">陽病外症未解不可下々之為逆可見下</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f06-left-body-07" xml:id="u-f06-left-body-07">之為逆者言非其道也外症未解之時假</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f06-left-body-08" xml:id="u-f06-left-body-08">令雖有可下之証容易不可下也若欲下</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f06-left-body-09" xml:id="u-f06-left-body-09">之欲與大承氣當先與小承氣探試之是</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f06-left-body-10" xml:id="u-f06-left-body-10">則仲景氏之深旨也經〔缺損〕先救裡後</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f06-left-red_inline-01" xml:id="u-f06-left-red_inline-01">猶</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f06-left-red_inline-02" xml:id="u-f06-left-red_inline-02">之</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f06-left-red_inline-03" xml:id="u-f06-left-red_inline-03">得</ab>
          <note type="editorial">body_red</note>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="7" type="scan" corresp="https://iiif.lib.keio.ac.jp/FJK/F-i-1/pdf/F-i-1.pdf#page=7">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <ab type="body" n="f07-right-body-01" xml:id="u-f07-right-body-01">救表法何傷寒医下之續〔缺損〕下清穀不</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f07-right-body-02" xml:id="u-f07-right-body-02">止身疼痛者急可救裡後身疼痛清便自</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f07-right-body-03" xml:id="u-f07-right-body-03">調者急可救表救裡宜四逆湯救表宜桂</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f07-right-body-04" xml:id="u-f07-right-body-04">枝湯大抵有表裡症者先救表後救裡此</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f07-right-body-05" xml:id="u-f07-right-body-05">則反之此無佗下利清穀此之他証則最</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f07-right-body-06" xml:id="u-f07-right-body-06">急劇故先救其急後其緩也例云下利清</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f07-right-body-07" xml:id="u-f07-right-body-07">穀不可攻表汗出必脹滿是則誤治所致</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f07-right-body-08" xml:id="u-f07-right-body-08">為医者不可不識也楊氏亦云予治病如</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f07-right-body-09" xml:id="u-f07-right-body-09">奕碁當先救急々者何救其重略其輕也</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f07-right-body-10" xml:id="u-f07-right-body-10">又金匱云夫病痼疾加以卒病先治卒病</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f07-right-red_inline-01" xml:id="u-f07-right-red_inline-01">為危</ab>
          <note type="editorial">body_red</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <ab type="body" n="f07-left-body-01" xml:id="u-f07-left-body-01">後治痼疾由是觀之有表裡證者先救其</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f07-left-body-02" xml:id="u-f07-left-body-02">急後其緩諦矣若誤失表裡先後之機毫</ab>
          <ab type="body" n="f07-left-body-03" xml:id="u-f07-left-body-03">釐之差千里之謬學者當詳審焉</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f07-left-red_comment-01" xml:id="u-f07-left-red_comment-01">文簡意明篇中之上乘</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f07-left-red_comment-02" xml:id="u-f07-left-red_comment-02">我等醫得此書者欲使蒼生被我仁心乎當時庸倉</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f07-left-red_comment-03" xml:id="u-f07-left-red_comment-03">林請看牆外一方人此予素志也而當時窮留身於</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f07-left-red_comment-04" xml:id="u-f07-left-red_comment-04">一室隔風埃中未得挾羽翩達八表是以志氣摧折學</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f07-left-red_comment-05" xml:id="u-f07-left-red_comment-05">業就廢古人曰少年太弟一生悔於予有是矣如予青</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f07-left-red_comment-06" xml:id="u-f07-left-red_comment-06">年立志態々就學以莫有外事〔缺損〕然有不</ab>
          <note type="editorial">body_red</note>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="8" type="scan" corresp="https://iiif.lib.keio.ac.jp/FJK/F-i-1/pdf/F-i-1.pdf#page=8">
        <div type="surface" n="right">
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f08-right-red_comment-01" xml:id="u-f08-right-red_comment-01">可語之勢其為可談耳雖然〔缺損〕一介</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f08-right-red_comment-02" xml:id="u-f08-right-red_comment-02">忽變白頭惟日夜相勉不息其餘在可顧而已此予之所</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f08-right-red_comment-03" xml:id="u-f08-right-red_comment-03">警予併以自警耳燈下一讀書之識語</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f08-right-red_comment-04" xml:id="u-f08-right-red_comment-04">安政六年仲□十有七日</ab>
          <ab type="red_comment" n="f08-right-red_comment-05" xml:id="u-f08-right-red_comment-05">桃蹊迂人妄批</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f08-right-red_inline-01" xml:id="u-f08-right-red_inline-01">不學將何如</ab>
          <ab type="red_inline" n="f08-right-red_inline-02" xml:id="u-f08-right-red_inline-02">之為</ab>
          <note type="editorial">red_comment</note>
        </div>
        <div type="surface" n="left">
          <note type="editorial">blank</note>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div n="9" type="scan" corresp="https://iiif.lib.keio.ac.jp/FJK/F-i-1/pdf/F-i-1.pdf#page=9">
